From 7b4b3cea1fb9a6c86f677dbfe60d8868d5c28e0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 06:45:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Daily session in the app: purpose first, the takeaway
 card, a linked second question, an honest close, Hoy
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Opening (P0-2): a day with a purpose opens on «Por qué hoy», «Hoy te llevas»
  (the empty card, one slot per card step, hint as the empty line), the week's
  note on its first day and «La última vez anotaste» after it, then Empezar.
  Never on a resume (an answer, a draft with words, the remembered step, a step
  link); the phone remembers her step only once she is past the opening.
- Second question (P0-3): «Tu elección · …» with Cambiar (back to the first,
  pre-selected; the draft is kept with what it was written under), then the
  heading, the line and the field. Elara's note to the first question moves
  under the field, set second, and hides while the keyboard is up. A changed
  choice over a kept draft says so once.
