- The V2 mentor prompt (one move, no praise, no question, nothing she did
  not say, never "safe" or "free", never her timing) is used on days with a
  `purpose`. Every other day keeps the prompt it had, verbatim
  (`legacyStepInstructions`), as DESIGN-DECISIONS keeps other days' behaviour
  until they are given a purpose.
- On a session day an honest «No sé» goes to the model under the rule to
  accept it plainly with no task, instead of the invitation to try again
  (pressure test "Unsure"). A greeting or a test string is still invited to
  try again, and other days are unchanged.
- Q2's row shows the label over her words («Tu elección» / «Mejorar mi trabajo
  actual»), as on her card: at a large text size her choice keeps both lines.
- Under the field, Elara's note to the question before gives way to this
  step's own reply when there is one, so an invitation to try again is read
  right under her words, not below the fold.

